    {
      "number": 11,
      "category": "",
      "title": "潘淑妃傳",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-011-panshufei:p001",
      "count": 1,
      "raw_count": 1,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "潘淑妃者，本以貌進，始未見賞。帝好乘羊車經諸房，淑妃每莊飾褰帷以候，並密令左右以鹹水灑地。帝每至戶，羊輒舐地不去。帝曰：「羊乃為汝徘徊，況於人乎。」于此愛傾後宮。",
      "paragraph_ids": [
        "c-nanshi-011-panshufei:p001"
      ],
      "mention_ids": [
